  everyone is informed about consent.\n* Please arrive clean & as scent fre
 e as possible.\n* BE SOBER: Please do not drink or smoke before or at this
  event.\n\n**WHAT TO BRING:** personal water bottle and snacks to share\, 
 a friend\, a date – whatever cuddle accessories you like! The only thing
  that you are required to bring is a clean and sober you.\n\nThese events 
 are not "gender balanced".\n\n**We take individual and group safety seriou
 sly!** If you experience\, see\, or know that one of our participants is n
